OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after hoax threat
OL,4,Asparked evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after hoax
OL,7,Fthreats an explosive device had been
OL,8,Fplaced at a library led to an
OL,9,Fevacuation, police have said.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called at about 11:50 BST to
OL,13,FChurston Library in Paignton following
OL,14,Fthe threats.
OL,16,FThe premises was evacuated and a cordon
OL,17,Fwas put in place as officers carried
OL,18,Fout inquiries, but no evidence of a
OL,19,Fdevice was found, the force said.
OL,21,FA man in his 40s was arrested and he
OL,22,Fremained in police custody, it said.
